\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {10}{\ignorespaces Training convergence diagnostics. (a)~Evaluation return over training for all observation schemas and both policy parameterizations (single seed). The arrow highlights late-stage policy collapse in feed-forward PPO, which does not affect deployment due to best-model checkpointing. (b)~Policy entropy evolution. Recurrent PPO with instantaneous and forecast-only schemas exhibits entropy collapse below the shaded zone, explaining the fixed-configuration behavior in Table~\ref {tab:ablation_obs}. (c)~Evaluation return across five independent seeds for the two best-performing configurations, with $\pm 1$ standard deviation bands.}}{19}{figure.caption.15}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:training_diagnostics}{{10}{19}{Training convergence diagnostics. (a)~Evaluation return over training for all observation schemas and both policy parameterizations (single seed). The arrow highlights late-stage policy collapse in feed-forward PPO, which does not affect deployment due to best-model checkpointing. (b)~Policy entropy evolution. Recurrent PPO with instantaneous and forecast-only schemas exhibits entropy collapse below the shaded zone, explaining the fixed-configuration behavior in Table~\ref {tab:ablation_obs}. (c)~Evaluation return across five independent seeds for the two best-performing configurations, with $\pm 1$ standard deviation bands}{figure.caption.15}{}}
